"""Generate every figure and number used in the Part 2 report.

    python make_report_results.py                 # sim1..sim7, writes ./report/Resources
    python make_report_results.py sim3 sim4       # only some
    python make_report_results.py all bonus       # include the sensor-noise extra credit
    python make_report_results.py --out my_dir    # other output folder

Outputs
-------
<out>/Resources/p2_*.png   figures, with the file names the LaTeX sources expect
<out>/s5_rows.tex          per-direction table rows of Simulation 5
<out>/results_macros.tex   one \\def per metric; the report prints them with \\res{key}

Only the provided engine is used (run_case_part_2.py building blocks).  The
design sea of the assignment is Hs = 1.5 m, so Hs is set explicitly here
instead of using run_case_part_2.WAVES_HS.
"""
